# RUNS — job / artifact registry

Optional slot — present only if this campaign runs long jobs whose outputs need provenance.

## Scheme

`{{RUNS_ROOT}}/<series>/r<NNN>_<slug>/`

- **`r<NNN>`** — one global sequential run number, never reused, never reset.
- **`<slug>`** — short purpose tag.
- **`<series>/`** — one directory per model-of-record era.
- Every run gets a row here at launch (number, date, ticket, purpose) and a status on
  completion (ok / crashed / superseded, keep / purge).
- Capture BOTH streams on every long launch:
  `<cmd> > >(tee -a stdout.log) 2> >(tee -a stderr.log >&2)`.

